Background PiP integration notice
=================================

The independent Lipstick notification-surface setup, explicit Wayland input
region, and empty opaque-region behavior in SiliSili's SystemPipController were
adapted from the mechanisms demonstrated by screentapshot-lipstick:

  https://github.com/CODeRUS/screentapshot-lipstick
  reference commit: b086b0a05caa752b97fbc79c4ae42f52d7308426

The referenced project declares the WTFPL license. SiliSili does not use its
whole-output recorder protocol; background video is presented from SiliSili's
existing application-owned shared video texture and decoder.
